msgstr "马桥人工智能创新试验区"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Minhang | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜闵行区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:8
msgid ""
"The Minhang 2025-2026 park plan links Grand neoBay R&D with Maqiao "
"manufacturing. A useful pathway from a robot prototype to supply-chain "
"and production conversations."
msgstr "闵行2025至2026年园区方案连接大零号湾研发与马桥制造，可作为机器人样机走向供应链及生产对接的路径。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S018 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/gwk/search/content/9f1fbc635cbf4749aa3f384e47d80aea>`_. "
"闵行区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区闵行园区改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S018 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/gwk/search/content/9f1fbc635cbf4749aa3f384e47d80aea>`_. 闵行区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区闵行园区改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/gwk/search/content/9f1fbc635cbf4749aa3f384e47d80aea>`_"
msgstr "`官方来源与主管部门入口 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/gwk/search/content/9f1fbc635cbf4749aa3f384e47d80aea>`_"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:24
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:33
msgid ""
"Describe the prototype, required equipment, process and testing needs."
msgstr "说明样机、所需设备、工艺与测试需求。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:35
msgid "Ask for a technical review, facility visit and itemized quotation."
msgstr "申请技术审核、设施参观及逐项报价。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:37
msgid ""
"Agree access, safety, sample and IP ownership, test scope and acceptance."
msgstr "约定准入、安全、样本与知识产权、测试范围及验收。"

#: ../../entities/maqiao.rst:39
msgid ""
"Separate the facility contract from investment or public-funding "
"applications."
msgstr "设施合同与投资或财政资助分别申请。"

